    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ten minutes isn't going to fix a life that's completely collapsed. it feels less like i need a break and more like i need everything to just... stop. permanently. the pressure doesn't go away, it just stays there forever. it feels like the only way to actually get any peace or stop the cycle is to just exit the whole thing entirely. does that even make sense? it feels like the only logical conclusion left.",
